  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "The quotient of cube roots of two numbers is equal to a cube root of the quotient of the numbers. Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{16}}{\\sqrt[3]{2}}=\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{16}{2}}=\\sqrt[3]{8}=2.\n$$",
